  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Association Spectra - Tools to build a feminist future - democracy, community and solidarity: SECOND EDITION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spectra&apos;s project &quot;Tools to build a feminist future - democracy, community and solidarity: SECOND EDITION&quot; is the continuation of the project Of the same name, 1st edition (Ref: SE-ON-802401-6134-WB-ME1) under the 2024-2025 programme &#x201c;The Kvinna till Kvinna Regional Programme - Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&#x201d; (Ref: SE-ON-802401-6134-WB).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&#x2019;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents 2.0&quot; the partner organisation Spectra is implementing the 8 - month project &quot;Tools to build a feminist future - democracy, community and solidarity: SECOND EDITION &quot;. This project will contribute to the strengthening of the feminist movement able to counter the anti-democratic agendas in Montenegro in an effective, educated and strategic manner and advance feminist values in Montenegrin society.</narrative>
  </description>
